**Overall:** Terpel has the strongest fundamental evidence, with dated quarterly results across Q1 and Q2 2026 and two named contracts. Éxito has dated H1 results and a scheduled catalyst on 29 Oct. Argos has a clearly dated set of capital-return decisions, but they fall outside the window. None of the three has window-dated news confirmed end to end. If a wholesale-only mandate is required, the BVC universe does not offer a second strict wholesale name from these searches; a broader search of Colombian distributors would be needed.